			"notes": "Realistic Overhaul 2.1.0 for Minecraft Java 1.20.1 (Fabric).\n\nInstall: put `realistic-overhaul-2.1.0.jar` in `.minecraft/mods` together with Fabric API for 1.20.1 (Fabric Loader 0.14.21 or newer).\nSettings: press **O** in game, or Options > Realistic Overhaul...\n\nNew in 2.1.0:\n- Puddles with irregular shapes that join together, a wet shiny look and rain ripples.\n- Snow dunes and drifts against walls, smooth wavy snow surface, blowing snow.\n- Creepy mobs: hunched limping zombies, twitching skeletons and endermen, breathing creepers, fidgeting spiders, glowing eyes in the dark.\n\nFrom 2.0.0: NoCubes-style smooth terrain, realistic terrain generation for new worlds, step-up, limb ragdolls, blood, limping hurt mobs.\nSmooth terrain needs Indium if you use Sodium."
		},
