			"notes": "Realistic Overhaul 2.0.0 for Minecraft Java 1.20.1 (Fabric).\n\nInstall: put `realistic-overhaul-2.0.0.jar` in `.minecraft/mods` together with Fabric API for 1.20.1 (Fabric Loader 0.14.21 or newer).\nSettings: press **O** in game, or Options > Realistic Overhaul...\n\nNew in 2.0.0: NoCubes-style smooth terrain, realistic terrain generation for new worlds (bigger continents, taller mountains), 1-block step-up with smooth camera, limb ragdolls on corpses, blood splatter, hurt mobs limp, a scrollable settings screen with more options, and a settings button in the Options menu.\n\nSmooth terrain needs Indium if you use Sodium."
